"SVFS.DesertMarigoldSeeds.Description": "Plant in summer. Takes 7 days to produce a bright gold flower.",
"SVFS.NasturtiumSeeds.Description": "Plant in spring or summer. Takes 10 days to produce bold red flowers, and then continues to produce every 3 days.",
"SVFS.PaintedTongueSeeds.Description": "Plant in spring. Takes 8 days to produce a vibrant pinkish-purple flower.",
"SVFS.PassionFlowerSeeds.Description": "Plant in summer. Takes 10 days to produce a large, oddly shaped white and purple flower, and then continues to produce every 4 days.",
"SVFS.CeladonPersianLilySeeds.Description": "Plant in spring or summer. Takes 9 days to produce a serene green flower.",
