"SVFS.ByzantiumPersianLilySeeds.Description": "Plant in spring or summer. Takes 9 days to produce a deep dusk-purple flower.",
"SVFS.SangriaStJohnsWortSeeds.Description": "Plant in fall. Takes 6 days to produce a cheerful yellow flower.",
"SVFS.BluePuyaCutting.Description": "A cutting from a rare plant found high in the mountains. Takes 36 days to mature into a large, spiky frond that produces a vivid teal flower in late spring and early summer.",
"SVFS.PlumeriaSapling.Description": "The sapling of a prized flowering tree known for its fragrant summer and fall blooms. Takes 28 days to grow into a mature Plumeria Tree. Only grows if the 8 surrounding tiles are empty.",
"SVFS.HarlequinGlorybowerSapling.Description": "A rare sapling of mysterious origin. Takes 28 days to grow into a mature Harlequin Glorybower Tree that produces small delicate flowers in spring and star-shaped berries in the fall. Only grows if the 8 surrounding tiles are empty.",
