"SVFS.BlushingBrideProtea.Description": "Categorized by the soft pink hues highlighting delicate spiky petals, this flower gets its namesake from the blushed cheeks of a bride on her wedding day. ",
"SVFS.DarwinsSlippers.Description": "Named after a famous scientist and philosopher, these intense, orange slipper-shaped flowers evoke warmth, a stark contrast for the snowy environment it grows in.",
"SVFS.DesertMarigold.Description": "A rare flower found in remote desert regions, this bright yellow and orange flower emanates warmth and radiant joy.",
"SVFS.Nasturtium.Description": "In ancient times, Nasturtium was planted after victory in combat to honor the bravery and sacrifice of those who fought.",
"SVFS.PaintedTongue.Description": "Prized by horticultural societies around the world for its kaleidoscopic patterns, the Painted Tongue is a captivating addition to any garden.",
"SVFS.PassionFlower.Description": "This vine-growing flower was originally found in the private garden of a great ruler who, upon losing his greatest love, vowed to never forget. This vine-growing plant must be carefully tended to prevent overspreading.",
"SVFS.CeladonPersianLily.Description": "A rare variety of a mysterious plant whose bell-shaped flowers are believed to chime in the presence of fairies.",
"SVFS.MidnightPersianLily.Description": "A rare variety of a mysterious plant whose bell-shaped flowers are believed to chime in the presence of fairies.",
"SVFS.SunrisePersianLily.Description": "A rare variety of a mysterious plant whose bell-shaped flowers are believed to chime in the presence of fairies.",
"SVFS.SunsetPersianLily.Description": "A rare variety of a mysterious plant whose bell-shaped flowers are believed to chime in the presence of fairies.",
"SVFS.StarburstPersianLily.Description": "A rare variety of a mysterious plant whose bell-shaped flowers are believed to chime in the presence of fairies.",
"SVFS.ByzantiumPersianLily.Description": "A rare variety of a mysterious plant whose bell-shaped flowers are believed to chime in the presence of fairies.",
"SVFS.SangriaStJohnsWort.Description": "This flowering plant gets its namesake from a gentle wanderer who believed these bright yellow and red flowers could soothe heartache.",
"SVFS.BluePuyaFlower.Description": "Also known as the 'Sapphire Tower,' the Blue Puya is believed to bring luck to those who successfully cultivate it.",
"SVFS.WhitePlumeria.Description": "A species of tropical flowers used for millenia to make rare perfumes, its scent evokes serenity and wonder.",
"SVFS.PinkPlumeria.Description": "A species of tropical flowers used for millenia to make rare perfumes, its scent evokes serenity and wonder.",
"SVFS.HarlequinGlorybower.Description": "The flowers of a legendary tree that stories tell can change a person's luck.",
