//PRE-EVENT SETUP
"SVFS.EvelynLetter.text": "Dear Mrs. Mullner,^^As you may already know, this year we are holding our annual Flower Show in Stardew Valley.#Each year, Society members submit nominations for the next year's event participants, and we are pleased to extend an invitation to you to participate in this year's Grand Prize Showcase!#Please send your response via expedited post. We look forward to hearing from you! ^Sincerely, ^^S. Woodward and C. Parker-Hodges^Chairs, Ferngill Botanical Society",
"SVFS.Invitation.name": "SVFS Invitation",
"SVFS.Invitation.text": "Dear Resident,^^We do hope^you will attend.^^Sincerely^Carl Parker-Hodges &^Samantha Woodward^Chairs^FBS^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ALT TEXT^FOR ACCESSIBILITY^In your hand you hold^a thick card embossed^with intricate^floral designs^in the corners.^The text says:^The Ferngill Botanical^Society Presents the^Stardew Valley^Flower Show,^Wednesday & Thursday,^Summer 3 to 4.",
"SVFS.ReminderMail.name": "The Flower Show!",
"SVFS.ReminderMail.text": "@,^^Don't forget, the Stardew Valley Flower Show is tomorrow. For all that she's done for us, we must go show our support to Evelyn. I'll bring tea and biscuits!^^--Caroline",

//FLOWER SHOW
"SVFS.Locations.FlowerShowForest": "Cindersap Forest Clearing, Stardew Valley Flower Show",
"SVFS.FlowerShow.name": "Stardew Valley Flower Show",
