// EVENT #1 - EVELYN IS INVITED
"SVFS.Invited.Jodi.01": "Oh, @! You won't believe it! Evelyn, show @ what you received!$1",
"SVFS.Invited.Jodi.02": "Same!",
"SVFS.Invited.Jodi.03": "Agreed! You are going to enter, right?",
"SVFS.Invited.Evelyn.01": "So much to do...",
"SVFS.Invited.Evelyn.02": "I go to the Flower Show every year, but I never thought...$0#$b#Well, I'd never imagined I'd be asked to make a floral display for the showcase!$4",
"SVFS.Invited.Evelyn.03": "Yes, I think I will! This should be fun!",
"SVFS.Invited.Caroline.01": "This is amazing, Evelyn! Of course you should be invited!$1#$b#Your seasonal displays around town are always so unique and lovely. I'm sure your entry for the showcase will be beautiful.$4",
"SVFS.Invited.Caroline.02": "I can't wait for the Flower Show!",
"SVFS.Invited.Caroline.03": "Oh you must!",

// EVENT #2 - FLOWER SHOW FINAL EVENT
"SVFS.FinalShow.Jodi.01": "It's time!",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Jodi.02": "Oh, Evelyn, it is stunning! You really do work magic with flowers.",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Emily.01": "This is so exciting!",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Emily.02": "Ooooh!!",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Jas.01": "Aunt Marnie, look!",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Jas.02": "So pretty",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Samantha.01": "Welcome, everyone, to the 21st Annual Ferngill Botanical Society Flower Show! We hope you've enjoyed the event so far.#$b#Today we are presenting the winner of the Grand Prize Showcase. Entrants were judged based on several criteria: quality and choice of flowers and greenery, originality, balance, color harmony, and the sense of rhythm in the arrangement.",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Samantha.02": "And now, the moment you've been waiting for. The winner of this year's Grand Prize Showcase is...#$b#Mrs. Evelyn Mullner! We chose this arrangement for its use of color, the pops of white Snowballs helping to strike a perfect balance between the yellow Lilies circling the central Nasturtiums.",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Samantha.03": "Judging this year's arrangements was difficult! All of them were beautiful.#$b#Mrs. Mullner, if you and your husband would like to join us for a group photo?",
"SVFS.FinalShow.George.01": "About dang time.",
"SVFS.FinalShow.George.02": "Eh, those other folks didn't stand a chance.",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Carl.01": "We've narrowed down the field to two final arrangements.#$b#The first, as seen here, has a serene visual appeal, the designer choosing a narrow color palette to call attention to the unique shape of the central flowers themselves. It has good balance, a strong focal point, and the use of Baby's Breath among the greenery evokes a sense of wonder and surprise.#$b#Thank you to Ms Marysue St. Francis, of Grampleton, for this prime example of refined elegance.",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Carl.02": "The second entry, as shown here, showcases several unique species, in perfect condition. It has a more contemporary, vibrant visual appeal, the designer opting for a color palette that calls to mind images of nebulas.#$b#The balance is quite good, considering the saturated palette, and the use of pale blue Lupines among the greenery helps to create a rhythm of peaks and valleys that finally calls you back to the central flowers.#$b#Thank you to Mrs. Evelyn Mullner, for this stunning, colorful arrangement.",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Carl.03": "Congratulations, Mrs. Mullner! I must say, your use of color is quite extraordinary.",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Alex.01": "Yeah! Go Grams!",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Caroline.01": "I just knew you would win. Congratulations, Evelyn!",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Evelyn.01": "My goodness!",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Evelyn.02": "I don't know what to say. I'm honored. Thank you!$4",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Evelyn.03": "Shush, George.",
"SVFS.FinalShow.Lewis.01": "Congratulations, Evelyn!",
"SVFS.Carl.DisplayName": "Carl Parker-Hodges",
"SVFS.Samantha.DisplayName": "Samantha Woodward",
"SVFS.FSPhoto": "A commemorative photo of Evelyn, George, and the Flower Show Judges.",
"SVFS.FinalMessage": "Evelyn's flower display really is beautiful. What a lovely end to the Flower Show.",

// CTS
"SVFS.CT.Abigail.FlowerShowHype": "A Flower Show doesn't seem all that exciting, but who knows, it might be fun!",
"SVFS.CT.Alex.FlowerShowHype": "My grandma knows everything about flowers. She'll win this thing!",
"SVFS.CT.Caroline.FlowerShowHype": "Evelyn always puts together the most beautiful seasonal displays here in town. I just know she'll win the Flower Show!",
"SVFS.CT.Clint.FlowerShowHype": "Oh, hi @. Did you hear about the Flower Show?#$b#I don't know what those are, to be honest, but I should probably go, just to show my support for Evelyn.",
"SVFS.CT.Demetrius.FlowerShowHype": "Hi, Farmer. Do you know much about this Flower Show that's happening?#$b#I have to wonder if the flowers are grown locally or if there will be plants from more exotic places.#$b#It certainly will be fascinating to see.",
"SVFS.CT.Elliott.FlowerShowHype": "I used to be a member of the Ferngill Botanical Society, did you know?#$b#It's a wonderful institution, and though I've not attended previous years' events, I'm looking foward to this weekend.",
"SVFS.CT.Emily.FlowerShowHype": "Isn't this exciting, @? A Flower Show! I just know that it's going to be beautiful!",
"SVFS.CT.Evelyn.FlowerShowHype": "At my age I should be past worrying about things I can't control, but I'll admit, I'm nervous and excited for the Flower Show!#I have a great idea for what I'll submit to the judges. I just hope they like it.",
"SVFS.CT.George.FlowerShowHype": "I hate flowers. Get my allergies fired up.#But my Evelyn loves them, and ain't no one better at making pretty displays as her.#$b#You better be there, hear?",
"SVFS.CT.Gus.FlowerShowHype": "*Flour...sugar...nutmeg...oh, I'm sorry @.#$b#I'm just thinking of making something special for Evelyn to show my support. You'll be at the Flower Show, yes?",
"SVFS.CT.Haley.FlowerShowHype": "Hi, Farmer. Are you going to the Flower Show? I am, of course.#$b#It will be a great opportunity to take photos, and I hear there will be a clothing stall.#$b#I wonder if there will be any fashionable items for sale.",
"SVFS.CT.Harvey.FlowerShowHype": "If you're going to attend the flower show, do be careful to look out for bees and wasps!",
"SVFS.CT.Jas.FlowerShowHype": "Oh @! Can you believe it?! Our very own Flower Show!#$b#Aunt Marnie says I can go because Miss Penny is going. I'm so excited!",
"SVFS.CT.Jodi.FlowerShowHype": "I can't think of anything more lovely than a Flower Show. You will be there, right? To support Evelyn?",
"SVFS.CT.Leah.FlowerShowHype": "I've always wanted to do a study on flowers. Maybe I'll bring my sketchbook to the show this weekend. You never know when inspiration will strike!",
"SVFS.CT.Lewis.FlowerShowHype": "What an honor that we are hosting the Flower Show this year!#$b#It's going to bring in so many tourists. I wonder if I should make a special sign to welcome visitors.",
"SVFS.CT.Linus.FlowerShowHype": "The natural world is a miracle, and nothing exemplifies it more than flowers do.#$b#I'm looking forward to attending the flower show, @, I hope you are, too.",
"SVFS.CT.Marnie.FlowerShowHype": "No one knows flowers like Evelyn. I can't wait to see her display for the Flower Show!",
"SVFS.CT.Maru.FlowerShowHype": "Hi, @! Looking forward to the Flower Show this weekend.#$b#I can't say that I know much about botany, but I do appreciate the beauty and wonder of flowers. Did you know that some plants can have differently colored flowers just by changing the pH balance of the soil?#$b#Fascinating, right?",
"SVFS.CT.Pam.FlowerShowHype": "I don't see why everyone is so excited over a few flowers.#$b#But I heard there will be free food and drinks, so this Flower Show might be worth checking out.",
"SVFS.CT.Penny.FlowerShowHype": "How lovely that Evelyn was invited to participate in the Flower Show!#$b#Will you be attending? I will be there. Maybe I'll put together a fun little assignment for the children around flowers!",
"SVFS.CT.Pierre.FlowerShowHype": "I heard there will be some stalls at the Flower Show. Do you know anything about them, @?#$b#I wonder who I would talk to about adding stock to my inventory...",
"SVFS.CT.Robin.FlowerShowHype": "I heard that one of the stalls at the Flower Show will be featuring local artisans. I wonder how I could find out if I could join in?",
"SVFS.CT.Sam.FlowerShowHype": "Hey Farmer. You going to this Flower Show thing this weekend?#$b#Eh, I don't know if I'm going...I'll probably skip it.",
"SVFS.CT.Sandy.FlowerShowHype": "Oh, hey there. Emily told me there's going to be a Flower Show in the Valley this weekend!#$b#It's so exciting! I love flowers. I've asked for some time off on Saturday so I can go.#Hope to see you there!",
"SVFS.CT.Sebastian.FlowerShowHype": "Oh, hi. I heard there's some kind of show happening this weekend?#$b#Not really my kind of thing. I don't know anything about flowers.",
"SVFS.CT.Shane.FlowerShowHype": "A Flower Show? No, not interested. Besides, I have to work.",
"SVFS.CT.Vincent.FlowerShowHype": "What happens at a Flower Show?#$b#It's not boring is it?",
"SVFS.CT.Willy.FlowerShowHype": "Can't say I know much about flowers, but I'm rooting for our Evelyn.",
"SVFS.CT.Wizard.FlowerShowHype": "The director of the Ferngill Botanical Society is an old friend. I've not seen him in many years...#$b#Hmmm did you say you were going? I'll admit I am curious to see the different cultivars.",

"SVFS.CT.Alex.FlowerShowOver": "The Grand Prize, @! Grams got the Grand Prize! I knew she would win it.",
"SVFS.CT.Caroline.FlowerShowOver": "I never doubted Evelyn would win the Grand Prize. Her eye for color is unmatched, wouldn't you agree?",
"SVFS.CT.Elliott.FlowerShowOver": "Well, @ was that not an amazing display of botanical wonder?#$b#I must say that I have been moved by the beauty and the nostalgia. This demands some thought. Excuse, me @.",
"SVFS.CT.Evelyn.FlowerShowOver": "@, thank you for your support. I will cherish the memories from this weekend. I'm so honored to have won the grand prize.",
"SVFS.CT.George.FlowerShowOver": "Never had a doubt my Evelyn would win. Hers was the best display there, hands down.",
"SVFS.CT.Jodi.FlowerShowOver": "I'm so proud of Evelyn, aren't you @? After seeing her display, I knew she would win. It was stunning!",
"SVFS.CT.Leah.FlowerShowOver": "Evelyn has agreed to make a bouquet for me to study!#$b#I made so many sketches at the Flower Show - I can't wait to get out my brushes and start painting!",
"SVFS.CT.Lewis.FlowerShowOver": "What a boon the Flower Show was for our town! So many visitors. I do hope we can host it again next year...",
"SVFS.CT.Pierre.FlowerShowOver": "Hi, Farmer @! Did you hear my news? I was able to source seeds and saplings from the Flower Show!#$b#Stop by tomorrow, I'll show you what's available.",
"SVFS.CT.Sandy.FlowerShowOver": "Did you enjoy the Flower Show, @? I did!#$b#I've never seen so many flowers, all in one place. And they all smelled so lovely!",

// SHOP DIALOGUE
"SVFS.shops.ClosedMessage": "Sorry, we're closed right now. We open at 10:00 am and close at 10:00 pm.",
"SVFS.shops.SeedsSaplings1": "Rare Seeds and saplings for sale. Sold exclusively for the Flower Show!",
"SVFS.shops.SeedsSaplings2": "Rare seeds and saplings for sale. Last day to get at the special Flower Show price!",
"SVFS.shops.FlowerClosedMessage": "Ah, bad timing, we're closed. Open at 10:00 AM, lights out at 10:00 PM.",
"SVFS.shops.FlowerShop1": "Fresh-cut flowers, grown right here in the Valley! Smell nice, look nice... Solid combo!",
"SVFS.shops.FlowerShop2": "Fresh-cut flowers, and hey, last day for Flower Show prices! Miss it and that's on you, just saying.",
"SVFS.shops.FurnitureShop1": "Selling unique potted plants and flower-themed decor!",
"SVFS.shops.FurnitureShop2": "Take home one of our unique Stone Garden arrangements today! Last chance!",
"SVFS.shops.ClothingClosedMessage": "Oh, sorry... we're closed right now. Were open from 10:00 am until 10:00 pm.",
"SVFS.shops.ClothingShop1": "We carry a small selection, but I picked pieces that work for a lot of different occasions.",
"SVFS.shops.ClothingShop2": "If you're thinking about trying a new style... this is a good place to start.",

// FESTIVAL SCHEDULE STRINGS
"SVFS.FS.Abigail.01": "I wasn't sure I'd come, but I'm glad I did. This is very pretty, and the music is quite soothing.",
"SVFS.FS.Alex.01": "Hey, @. I just stopped by to check on my Gram and show my support.",
"SVFS.FS.Caroline.01": "I've never seen flowers like these! I wonder if I could find some seeds for my sunroom...",
"SVFS.FS.Demetrius.01": "Platycodon grandiflorus...fascinating. Oh, hi @. Some species of flowers are considered invasive species. But don't worry! I don't think any of the species you see here pose a threat to Stardew Valley.",
"SVFS.FS.Elliott.01": "Hello, @. I was just reading this book that someone left behind. The author has a poetic sense of rhythm in their phrasing. Hmm...well, are you enjoying the Flower Show?",
"SVFS.FS.Emily.01": "@! Look at these...aren't they adorable? They look like a happy bunch of singing flowers. *hums a tune*$4",
"SVFS.FS.Evelyn.01": "I've never considered using Black-Eyed Susans as a focal point. This arrangement is quite unique.",
"SVFS.FS.Evelyn.02": "This Flower Show has given me lots of new ideas for the gardens in town!",
"SVFS.FS.George.01": "I've already sneezed ten times since I got here. Maybe I'll find a less crowded spot to wait before I walk Evelyn home.",
"SVFS.FS.Gus.01": "Hi, @! This outdoor kitchen is amazing! I wonder...",
"SVFS.FS.Haley.01": "The person who designed that dress made some bold choices. I like it.",
"SVFS.FS.Harvey.01": "I haven't seen many bees or wasps, thankfully. This is a nice, peaceful spot to spend a summer's afternoon. It's good to make time to slow down and relax.",
"SVFS.FS.Jas.01": "Farmer @! It's my birthday! I'm feeding the ducks while Aunt Marnie looks at the shops.#$b#Did you see all the pretty flowers? I love them all! Except maybe the orange ones. If they were purple it'd be better!",
"SVFS.FS.Jodi.01": "I'm going to have to expand my garden! I bought so many different flower seeds for next year.",
"SVFS.FS.Leah.01": "...maybe a little more shading under the petals...oh, hello, @! I'm trying to capture this flower here, the purple and pink one. The striations are amazing. And the pattern at the center? Wow. Nature never fails to astonish me.",
"SVFS.FS.Lewis.01": "This came together wonderfully. I wonder if I could talk to the event folks to see about a repeat for next year...",
"SVFS.FS.Lewis.02": "Hi, @. Have you enjoyed the Flower Show?",
"SVFS.FS.Linus.01": "Despite the number of people here, I'm quite relaxed. Nature's splendor tends to have that effect.",
"SVFS.FS.Marnie.01": "This would look lovely in my kitchen, don't you think, @?",
"SVFS.FS.Maru.01": "What a neat festival! I'll have to remember this spot - it would be a great place to sit and think.",
"SVFS.FS.Penny.01": "I don't know which flower is my favorite. Do you have a favorite, @?",
"SVFS.FS.Pierre.01": "I'm waiting to speak to the shopowner about selling these seeds at the General Store.",
"SVFS.FS.Robin.01": "Hi, @! I'm thinking of picking up a bouquet to take home. I really like this one, don't you?",
"SVFS.FS.Willy.01": "This would be a mighty fine spot to fish. I shoulda brought my gear but didn't think too deep into it. I came to support Ms Evelyn after all.",

// FESTIVAL SCHEDULE STRINGS - COMPAT - VMV
"SVFS.FS.AsterPellegrinVMV.01": "$query PLAYER_NPC_RELATIONSHIP Current AsterPellegrinVMV Married#I really like that raised stone bed with the Darwin's Slippers. Do you think we could get one for our garden?|I am glad I came. It's quite a distance from home, but it was a lovely walk. I'm hoping to take home seed packets for several of these new flower varieties.",
"SVFS.FS.AsterPellegrinVMV.02": "Oh, did you meet Mr. Parker-Hodges, @? I have been communicating with him for some months now. His published study on the cross-pollination of orchids was fascinating. It's nice to finally meet him in person. This has been a wonderful event!",
"SVFS.FS.MaddyPellegrinVMV.01": "Aster was so excited about today that I had to join her. I wonder if the river here has good fishing?",
"SVFS.FS.NaveenFaycombeSereneVMV.01": "Hello, @. I heard about the Flower Show and thought it might be nice to leave the workshop for a bit. I've been working on a complicated piece. The break was welcome.",
"SVFS.FS.GavinPommerelVMV.01": "$query PLAYER_NPC_RELATIONSHIP Current GavinPommerelVMV Dating Engaged Married# It's a beautiful day in a peaceful place. I'm glad I get to spend it with you.|This place reminds me of summers when I was younger and had less worries. It's a nice feeling.",
}